 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how are you doing?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm great, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I get up to pee three times a night. It's ruining my sleep.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try to drink most of your water earlier in the day, and slow down in the last two hours before bed.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I do drink a huge glass right before bed.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's probably part of it. Tea and alcohol in the evening can also make it worse.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if I cut back",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "and it still happens?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.83,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it's worth checking with a doctor. Frequent waking to pee can have medical causes, and they're often easy to treat.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'll try the water thing first.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.26,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Give it a couple of weeks and see.",
